        "notes": "Ann, here is the estimate for the refacing of your kitchen and bathroom. As we discussed, my team will attempt to level the current paint conditions of the boxes by sanded. We will not be able to determine the amount of leveling we can do until we get started with the sanding due to not knowing the quality and type of paint previously used. I feel confident that we will be able to level the surface sufficiently to create a smooth factory finish. We will take all measures necessary to mitigate smells within the home by extracting the work-zone air while working. The majority of the work will be complete off-site but we will be working for a couple of days within the home during the repair(sanding) phase as well as the painting days for the boxes. Once we confirm a start date we can work together to determine the perfect blue we spoke about. Reach out with any questions. Thank you for your time and I look forward to working with you. ",
